      "round_summary": "Round 1/3: Replace broken assertNextStepWhen calls (p0_enters_cs_on_condition, p1_enters_cs_on_condition) with manual RegNext-based assertions. Root cause: Chisel FV's assertNextStepWhen compiles to Verilog SVA that drops the antecedent and |=> timing, leaving only the consequent (pc==L4) checked unconditionally — visible in peterson.sv lines 60-63 where _GEN_1 (pc_0==L3) is defined but never used. Fix: snapshot the antecedent with RegNext and check consequent on next cycle via fvAssert, preserving exact assertion labels.",
